  "published": "2025-12-30T10:03:26.517Z",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Initial release\n\t\t\t- Moved connection resolution infrastructure from CRUD Service\n\t\t\t- Added IConnectionMetadataProvider abstraction for flexible metadata sources\n\t\t\t- ConfigConnectionResolver: Resolves from appsettings.json\n\t\t\t- MetadataConnectionResolver: Resolves from metadata provider with 5-minute caching\n\t\t\t- ConnectionResolverFactory: Config-driven resolver selection\n\t\t\t- ConnectionHelper: Connection string building utilities\n\t\t\t- ResolvedConnection: Pre-built connection string wrapper\n\t\t\t- Supports SQL Server and PostgreSQL",
